ancient city into a cosmopolitan hotspot.\n\nPassport: Osaka\nBright lights, bath-houses and seafood markets \u2014 explore Japan\u2019s second city with a local who knows its best-kept secrets. \n\nOcean: The mystery corals\nLukas Isall of the Palau International Research Centre tells the story of some of the world\u2019s most beautiful and mysterious corals. \n\nOceans VR: Net positive\nExplore the case for limiting fishing on the high seas, from the viewpoint of diner, fish, fisherman and policymaker. \n\nRecoVR: Mosul, a collective reconstruction\nTour the Mosul Museum in Iraq, destroyed by Islamic State but recreated in VR in conjunction with Rekrei, a heritage project.", "short_description": "Virtual reality experiences from The Economist"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.economistgroup.com/results_and_governance/governance/privacy/index.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.economist.com/legal/terms-of-use", "publisher_name": "The Economist", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://vr.economist.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["NARRATIVE", "DOCUMENTARY_HISTORY", "NEWS_AND_INFORMATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED_FOR_DOWNLOAD", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": [], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "3122345907984451"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974695_883758371985484_2124568721870553088_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0vZDkPX4IDYQ7kNvwGSWTRb&_nc_